  "name": "Gravimetric_Snare",
  "full_name": "Warshade_Offensive.Umbral_Blast.Gravimetric_Snare",
  "short_name": "Gravimetric_Snare",
  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Gravimetric Snare",
  "display_fullname": "Warshade Offensive Umbral Blast Gravimetric Snare",
  "display_help": "You can hurl Gravimetric fibers to Snare your foes.  Gravimetric Snare can Immobilize a single target and crush them.  The target's attack rate and movement speed are also slowed, even if they resist the Immobilization effect. This power can be used while in Black Dwarf form and becomes a melee attack with a quicker cast time and higher damage. While in Black Dwarf form, this power may Knock Down the foe rather than leave them immobilized, in addition to taunting its target. Damage: Moderate Damage over time, Recharge: Fast",
  "display_short_help": "Ranged, Moderate DOT(Negative/Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Recharge, -SPD",
